{
  "name": "Warcry",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>When your allies are affected by your Inspiring Surge, you can choose to apply one of the following additional effects per ally:</p><ul><li>The target has Resistance to bludgeoning, piercing, and slashing damage until the start of your next turn.</li><li>The target's Speed is doubled until the start of your next turn.</li><li>The target has Advantage on melee weapon Attack Rolls until the start of your next turn, but Attack Rolls against it also have Advantage for the duration.</li></ul>",
